  "scope": "The actual FormedSelection formation relation supplies free typed parts, fuel and source to a staged selector process. A bookkeeping denomination preserves all source energy and retains remainder. Each orientation's assembly consumes two actual free parts into retained incorporated/spent matter and pays the old SelectorRevision assembly cost. Every operational history projects to the old law; an old history lifts exactly when its typed cumulative part demands fit inherited stocks. Paid formation, environmental reversal and reconstruction share one actual history. Favorable and blocked histories are verified. Assembly recipes, response coupling, retention law and phase restriction are supplied; this is not a derivation of chemistry, updater architecture, probability, robust success, moral direction or unbounded renewal."
